<task id="081" project="ebilling-r1">
  <metadata>
    <title>RuleSetService scope validation, scope lock, BU writes, routed ownership; id-keyed route checks; Draft re-scope; sprk_ruleset joins the secure family in one change; census Waived to Routed; guard and twin guard; the record-scoped source document is filed under its record (D-145)</title>
    <phase>3 Rules (WP3) — rule-set scope (D-171, D-172, D-141, D-145, D-146), wave W3-7</phase>
    <gate>080 done (S1-S4, S7 and sprk_createdbyperson on sprk_ruleset live on dev); uac-r2 #2150 (was #2143) and UAC T7 merged to master; ontology-r1 has created sprk_createdbyperson on sprk_policy and sprk_policyversion; owner OK for the live refusal probe and the two -Apply runs on dev (step 9); uac-r2 reviews every edit to its files (condition f)</gate>
